OL,3,GNEWSACouncil considers options to      
OL,4,Atackle budget strains                  
OL,6,FA council says it is in "regular       
OL,7,Fdialogue" with the government regarding
OL,8,Fthe financial pressures it faces and   
OL,9,Fthe funding available.                 
OL,11,FEarlier this month, North              
OL,12,FNorthamptonshire Council said it was   
OL,13,Ffacing an overspend of nearly #23m this
OL,14,Ffinancial year, which is more than 5%  
OL,15,Fof its budget.                         
OL,17,FLast week, the neighbouring West       
OL,18,FNorthamptonshire Council said it was   
OL,19,Falso talking to the government about a 
OL,20,Fpotential budget shortfall next year   
OL,21,Fand had opened a voluntary redundancy  
OL,22,Fwindow for staff.                      
